<view class="page"><view class="title">{{user ? '我的微信账号' : '欢迎来到 AI 门道。'}}</view><view class="muted">微信登录后自动创建或关联本站用户。</view><view wx:if="{{!user}}" class="card"><image src="/assets/logo.png" class="logo"/><view class="heading">微信一键登录</view><view class="muted">无需填写账号和密码。首次登录使用默认昵称、头像，你可以随后修改。</view><checkbox-group bindchange="agree"><label class="tiny"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{agreed}}"/>已阅读并同意隐私说明</label></checkbox-group><view class="link" bindtap="privacy">查看隐私说明</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">微信登录</button></view><view wx:else class="card"><image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" src="{{avatarUrl}}" class="avatar"/><view wx:else class="avatar">我</view><view wx:if="{{created}}" class="notice">已为你创建账号，可在下面完善个人资料。</view><text class="label">昵称</text><input type="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" data-field="nickname" bindinput="field" maxlength="24" placeholder="填写公开昵称"/><button bindtap="chooseAvatar">选择头像</button><button bindtap="defaultAvatar">使用默认头像</button><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">保存资料</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view><canvas class="hidden-canvas" canvas-id="avatar" style="width:256px;height:256px"/></view>
